{"1-6":{"people":[{"id":"israel-h3478","name":"Israel","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Isaac","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"solomon-h8010","name":"Solomon","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":1,"firstVerse":1},{"id":"zadok-h6659g","name":"Zadok","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":2,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"azariah-h5838g","name":"Azariah","kind":"person","brief":"A priest","count":1,"firstVerse":2},{"id":"ahijah-h0281g","name":"Ahijah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Seraiah","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"ahilud-h0286","name":"Ahilud","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Jehoshaphat","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"elihoreph-h0456","name":"Elihoreph","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Seraiah","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"jehoshaphat-h3092g","name":"Jehoshaphat","kind":"person","brief":"David's compatriot","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"seraiah-h8304g","name":"Seraiah","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Elihoreph","count":1,"firstVerse":3},{"id":"abiathar-h0054","name":"Abiathar","kind":"person","brief":"A High Priest","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"benaiah-h1141g","name":"Benaiah","kind":"person","brief":"David's warrior","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"jehoiada-h3077g","name":"Jehoiada","kind":"person","brief":"Father of warrior Benaiah","count":1,"firstVerse":4},{"id":"azariah-h5838h","name":"Azariah","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Nathan","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"nathan-h5416h","name":"Nathan","kind":"person","brief":"A prophet","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"zabud-h2071","name":"Zabud","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Nathan","count":1,"firstVerse":5},{"id":"abda-h5653g","name":"Abda","kind":"person","brief":"Father of Adoram","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"adoram-h0151","name":"Adoram","kind":"person","brief":"Son of Abda","count":1,"firstVerse":6},{"id":"ahishar-h0301","name":"Ahishar","kind":"person","brief":"","count":1,"firstVerse":6}],"places":[],"words":[{"base":"H5416","lemma":"נָתָן","tr":"na·tan","gloss":"Nathan","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":42},{"base":"H5838","lemma":"עֲזַרְיָ֫הוּ","tr":"a·zar·yah","gloss":"Azariah","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":48},{"base":"H6659","lemma":"צָדוֹק","tr":"tsa·doq","gloss":"Zadok","lang":"h","inPassage":2,"uses":53},{"base":"H3548","lemma":"כֹּהֵן","tr":"ko·hen","gloss":"priest","lang":"h","inPassage":3,"uses":750},{"base":"H0141","lemma":"אֲדֹנִירָם","tr":"a·do·ni·ram","gloss":"Adoniram","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H5653","lemma":"עַבְדָּא","tr":"av·da","gloss":"Abda","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":2},{"base":"H7463","lemma":"רֵעֶה","tr":"re·eh","gloss":"friend","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":3},{"base":"H0286","lemma":"אֲחִילוּד","tr":"a·chi·lud","gloss":"Ahilud","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":5},{"base":"H4522","lemma":"מַס","tr":"mas","gloss":"taskworker","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":23},{"base":"H0281","lemma":"אֲחִיָּ֫הוּ","tr":"a·chiy·yah","gloss":"Ahijah","lang":"h","inPassage":1,"uses":24}],"parallels":[],"crossrefs":[{"book":"1KI","chapter":2,"verse":35,"verseEnd":35,"votes":8,"source":"both","text":"And the king appointed Benaiah son of Jehoiada in Joabʼs place over the army, and he appointed Zadok the priest in Abiatharʼs place.","from":4},{"book":"2SA","chapter":8,"verse":16,"verseEnd":16,"votes":5,"source":"both","text":"Joab son of Zeruiah was over the army; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder;","from":3},{"book":"EXO","chapter":18,"verse":21,"verseEnd":21,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Furthermore, select capable men from among the people—God-fearing, trustworthy men who are averse to dishonest gain. Appoint them over the people as leaders of thousands, of hundreds, of fifties, and of tens.","from":2},{"book":"2SA","chapter":5,"verse":5,"verseEnd":5,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"In Hebron he reigned over Judah seven years and six months, and in Jerusalem he reigned thirty-three years over all Israel and Judah.","from":1},{"book":"2SA","chapter":7,"verse":2,"verseEnd":2,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"he said to Nathan the prophet, “Here I am, living in a house of cedar, while the ark of God remains in a tent.”","from":5},{"book":"2SA","chapter":8,"verse":15,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Thus David reigned over all Israel and administered justice and righteousness for all his people: Joab son of Zeruiah was over the army; Jehoshaphat son of Ahilud was the recorder; Zadok son of Ahitub and Ahimelech son of Abiathar were priests; Seraiah was the scribe; Benaiah son of Jehoiada was over the Cherethites and Pelethites; and Davidʼs sons were priestly leaders.","from":2},{"book":"2SA","chapter":8,"verse":18,"verseEnd":18,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Benaiah son of Jehoiada was over the Cherethites and Pelethites; and Davidʼs sons were priestly leaders.","from":5},{"book":"2SA","chapter":12,"verse":1,"verseEnd":15,"votes":0,"source":"tsk","text":"Then the LORD sent Nathan to David, and when he arrived, he said, “There were two men in a certain city, one rich and the other poor. The rich man had a great number of sheep and cattle, but the poor man had nothing except one small ewe lamb that he had bought. He raised it, and it grew up with him and his children. It shared his food and drank from his cup; it slept in his arms and was like a daughter to him. Now a traveler came to the rich man, who refrained from taking one of his own sheep or cattle to prepare for the traveler who had come to him. Instead, he took the poor manʼs lamb and prepared it for his guest.” David burned with anger against the man and said to Nathan: “As surely as the LORD lives, the man who did this deserves to die!","from":5}],"notes":[],"groups":[{"id":"kings-prophets","title":"Kings, prophets and the house of David","people":5},{"id":"royal-line","title":"The royal line: Judah to David to Jesus","people":2}]},"7-19":{"people":[{"id":"solomon-h8010","name":"Solomon","kind":"person","brief":"King of Judah","count":3,"firstVerse":7},{"id":"israel-h3478","na